      "status": "approve",
      "reviewer": "/root/research_b",
      "reasoning": "I retrieved the complete original Merlen1999 paper and visually inspected Table1 p42: it explicitly says L-Arginine·HCl1.90mM. The revised source-specific resolution to CHEBI31235 is supported. Generic Arginine HCl is not added globally, because its literal text alone still omits stereochemistry.",
