      "status": "approve",
      "reviewer": "/root/research_b",
      "reasoning": "The source formula adds Cl inside ammonium groups while its semantic annotation says Mohr salt. Removing chlorine is an identity change. The unresolved conflict is preserved rather than being hidden by familiar salt matching.",
