      "status": "approve",
      "reviewer": "/root/research_b",
      "reasoning": "I independently read both DSMZ1003 PDF pages: the trace entry is only Se-acid. This does not choose selenic versus selenous acid. The frozen normalization to selenic acid overstates evidence; source issue675 is justified, with no automatic replacement by H2SeO3.",
