      "reasoning": "TOGO explicitly names the tetrahydrate, supplier establishes CAS20908-72-9, and CHEBI75832 is the anhydrous parent only. I additionally read all concepts under primary MeSH C020748: the listed hydrate is heptahydrate, not tetrahydrate. Bounded search supports distinct CAS identity and broadMatch without falsely proving ontology-wide absence.",
